h_w4 of pembrolizumab (US)","timeFrame":"Week 4"},{"measure":"Ctrough_w4 of pembrolizumab (EU)","timeFrame":"Week 4"},{"measure":"Trough serum concentrations at steady state (Ctrough_ss) at pre-dose of ABP 234","timeFrame":"Week 16 through Week 19"},{"measure":"Ctrough_ss at pre-dose of pembrolizumab (US)","timeFrame":"Week 16 through Week 19"},{"measure":"Ctrough_ss at pre-dose of pembrolizumab (EU)","timeFrame":"Week 16 through Week 19"},{"measure":"Number of participants who experience a Treatment-emergent adverse event","timeFrame":"Up to 2.5 years"},{"measure":"Number of participants who experience a Treatment-emergent serious adverse event","timeFrame":"Up to 2.5 years"},{"measure":"Number of participants who experience a Treatment-emergent adverse event of interest","timeFrame":"Up to 2.5 years"},{"measure":"Number of participants who experience anti-drug antibodies (ADA)","timeFrame":"Up to 2.5 years"}]},"eligibilityModule":{"eligibilityCriteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n1. At least 18 years of age.\n2. Histologically or cytologically confirmed stage IV non-squamous Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer (NSCLC).\n3. Participant has no prior systemic treatment for advanced disease.\n4. Measurable disease according to RECIST v1.1.\n5. Tumor tissue from the resected site of disease must be available for biomarker analyses in order to be randomized.\n6. Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group performance status score 0 or 1.\n7. Epidermal growth factor receptor (EGFR), anaplastic lymphoma kinase (ALK), and c-ros oncogene 1, receptor tyrosine kinase of the insulin receptor family (ROS-1) negative\n8. Have a life expectancy of at least 3 months.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n1. Small cell lung cancer (SCLC) or mixed SCLC/NSCLC histology or squamous cell carcinoma.\n2. Participant has active central nervous system metastases not previously treated.\n3. Participant has active or known immune-mediated disorders.\n4. Participant has received prior systemic cytotoxic chemotherapy, immunotherapy (including PD-1/PD-L1), anti-neoplastic biological therapy, or targeted therapy for advanced/metastatic disease.\n5. Known hypersensitivity to monoclonal antibodies or to any of the excipients of the study drug, or to any component of cisplatin, carboplatin, or pemetrexed.","healthyVolunteers":false,"sex":"ALL","minimumAge":"18 Years","maximumAge":"99 Years","stdAges":["ADULT","OLDER_ADULT"]},"contactsLocationsModule":{"locations":[{"facility":"Precision NextGen Oncology and Research Center","city":"Beverly Hills","state":"California","zip":"90212","country":"United States","geoPoint":{"lat":34.07362,"lon":-118.40036}},{"facility":"TOI Clinical Research","city":"Cerritos","state":"California","zip":"90703","country":"United States","geoPoint":{"lat":33.85835,"lon":-118.06479}},{"facility":"Cancer and Blood Specialty Clinic (CBSC)","city":"Los Alamitos","state":"California","zip":"90720-3309","country":"United States","geoPoint":{"lat":33.80307,"lon":-118.07256}},{"facility":"Valkyrie Clinical Trials","city":"Los Angeles","state":"California","zip":"90067","country":"United States","geoPoint":{"lat":34.05223,"lon":-118.24368}},{"facility":"PIH Health Hospital","city":"Whittier","state":"California","zip":"90602","country":"United States","geoPoint":{"lat":33.97918,"lon":-118.03284}},{"facility":"Millennium Oncology - Hollywood","city":"Hollywood","state":"Florida","zip":"33024","country":"United States","geoPoint":{"lat":26.0112,"lon":-80.14949}},{"facility":"BRCR Medical Center Inc.","city":"Tamarac","state":"Florida","zip":"33321","country":"United States","geoPoint":{"lat":26.21286,"lon":-80.24977}},{"facility":"Accellacare Duly","city":"Plainfield","state":"Illinois","zip":"60585","country":"United States","geoPoint":{"lat":41.62697,"lon":-88.20395}},{"facility":"Accellacare of McFarland","city":"Ames","state":"Iowa","zip":"50010","country":"United States","geoPoint":{"lat":42.03471,"lon":-93.61994}},{"facility":"Detroit Clinical Research Center, PC","city"